      {
        "finding": "SPAR restores Res. Q to near vanilla on LLaVA with 0% ASR. On Qwen it fails to unlearn (ASR 80.33% vs vanilla 17%), so its near-vanilla Res. Q there does not show protection.",
        "proposed_claim": "Knowledge-hole mitigation via anchored SVD filtering works on some architectures but can block forgetting on others.",
