    "problems": "The paper reports no tests of the listed recovery attacks. The reported table results give no error bars or confidence intervals; response quality and refusal judgments use GPT-4o.",
    "rows_left_out": "Table 2 and Appendix Tables 5–6 contain SPAR ablations for the same benign knowledge-hole outcomes and were not included; they do not test recovery attacks. Figure 3 reports relative degradations without exact plotted values, so those values were not extracted.",
    "untested": [
