    "missing": [],
    "verdict_notes": "The study is irrelevant to the shallow-unlearning recovery claim; its construct is over-forgetting/collateral damage, not under-forgetting/recoverability. The authors' statement that baselines 'largely preserve model utility' does not hold for NPO, whose MMVet, POPE and VizWiz are 0.00 on both models. All metrics are GPT-4o judged, with no error bars. Table 2 contains 'TBD' entries, indicating an unfinished preprint. The record's relation and tranche (uses_without_test, T4) are accepted."
